========================================================================
THIRD-PARTY NOTICES & ACKNOWLEDGMENTS
========================================================================

This application incorporates or links to the following third-party components 
and open-source libraries:

- chess.js (https://github.com/jhlywa/chess.js) - BSD-2-Clause / MIT License
  Chess rule validation, legal move generation, FEN/SAN parsing, and game state.

- Chessboard.js (https://chessboardjs.com/ - Chris Oakman) - MIT License
  Interactive JavaScript chessboard interface and piece drag-and-drop mechanics.

- Stockfish Chess Engine (https://stockfishchess.org/ & https://github.com/niklasf/stockfish.js) - GPLv3 / Open Source
  Client-side Web Worker AI chess engine integration for analysis and AI play.

- Standard Chess Piece Vectors (Wikimedia Commons / cburnett / standard SVG piece set) - CC BY-SA 3.0
  High-resolution SVG chess piece graphical vectors.

- Lichess API & Live Embeds (https://lichess.org/) - AGPLv3 / Open API
  Interactive spectator broadcasts, Lichess TV embeds, and community team hub.
  All trademarks belong to their respective owners.

- ChessBase & Playchess Room (https://play.chessbase.com/) - Proprietary / Embeds
  External interactive chess club room and game services. All rights and 
  trademarks belong to ChessBase GmbH.

- Google Firebase SDK (https://firebase.google.com/) - Apache License 2.0
  Cloud Firestore NoSQL database and Firebase Web SDK client libraries. 
  Firebase is a trademark of Google LLC.

- PeerJS (https://peerjs.com/) - MIT License
  WebRTC Peer-to-Peer data connection wrapper for live browser-to-browser multiplayer.

- jQuery (https://jquery.com/) - MIT License
  DOM manipulation, event delegation, and asynchronous component loading.

- Bootstrap (https://getbootstrap.com/) - MIT License
  Responsive grid system and core UI styling components.

- FontAwesome Free (https://fontawesome.com/) - SIL OFL 1.1 / MIT License
  Iconography across UI panels, control headers, buttons, and navigation.

- Slick Carousel (https://kenwheeler.github.io/slick/) - MIT License
  Responsive carousel slider components.

- Legacy Cinnamon Chess Engine & Chess Strategy Online (http://cinnamonchess.altervista.org/)
  Historically utilized in early iterations; transitioned to native MChess custom board 
  and Stockfish Web Worker engine architecture.
